---
layout: layouts/guest.njk
permalink: /
guestHome: true
pageTitle: "Seascape Vacations | Bradenton & Sarasota Vacation Rentals Near Anna Maria Island"
pageDescription: "Private-pool vacation homes in Bradenton and Sarasota. Compare homes, plan with your group, and book direct with Seascape Vacations."
---
{% from "partials/ui-icon.njk" import uiIcon %}
{% set sceneSlugs = ['the-oasis', 'dockside-dreams', 'sarasota-luxe', 'river-house', 'bradenton-pool-home'] %}
{% set sceneCount = sceneSlugs | length %}
<div class="g-home">
  <section class="g-arrival" aria-labelledby="home-heading" data-home-scenes>
    <div class="g-arrival-copy"><p class="g-label">Private-pool homes · Bradenton & Sarasota</p><h1 id="home-heading">Your people.<br><em>Your place.</em></h1><p>A Gulf Coast home to call your own.<br>And a local team who knows it.</p></div>
    <div class="g-scenes">
      {% for slug in sceneSlugs %}{% set home = properties | propertyBySlug(slug) %}{% set photo = home.photography.photos[0] %}
      <div class="g-scene" id="scene-{{ home.slug }}" data-scene="{{ home.slug }}"{% if not loop.first %} hidden{% endif %}>
        <img class="g-scene-photo" data-transition-home="{{ home.slug }}" data-property-photo="{{ home.slug }}" {% if loop.first %}src="{{ photo.src }}" srcset="{{ photo.src | replace('.webp', '-800.webp') }} 800w, {{ photo.src }} {{ photo.width }}w" fetchpriority="high"{% else %}data-scene-src="{{ photo.src }}" data-scene-srcset="{{ photo.src | replace('.webp', '-800.webp') }} 800w, {{ photo.src }} {{ photo.width }}w"{% endif %} sizes="100vw" width="{{ photo.width }}" height="{{ photo.height }}" alt="{{ photo.alt }}">
        <div class="g-scene-caption"><div><p class="g-label">In the collection · {{ home.city }}, Florida</p><h2>{{ home.name }}</h2><p>{{ home.guestFacts.tagline }}</p></div><a class="g-scene-explore" href="{{ home.pageUrl }}" data-trip-link>Explore this home <span aria-hidden="true">{{ uiIcon('arrow-up-right') }}</span></a><span class="g-scene-index" aria-hidden="true">{{ "0" if loop.index < 10 else "" }}{{ loop.index }}<small>/{{ "0" if sceneCount < 10 else "" }}{{ sceneCount }}</small></span></div>
      </div>{% endfor %}
    </div>

    <a class="g-arrival-seal" href="#home-collection-heading" aria-label="Explore our homes"><span>OUR HOMES</span><strong>One good<br>getaway.</strong><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
  </section>
  <nav class="g-scene-picker" aria-label="Preview our homes">{% for slug in sceneSlugs %}{% set home = properties | propertyBySlug(slug) %}<a href="{{ home.pageUrl }}" data-trip-link data-scene-choice="{{ home.slug }}"{% if loop.first %} class="is-active"{% endif %}><img data-property-photo="{{ home.slug }}" src="{{ home.photography.photos[0].src | replace('.webp', '-800.webp') }}" width="64" height="64" alt="" loading="lazy"><span><strong>{{ home.name }}</strong><small>Up to {{ home.guests }} guests</small></span><span class="g-scene-choice-arrow" aria-hidden="true">{{ uiIcon('arrow-up-right') }}</span></a>{% endfor %}</nav>
  <p class="g-scene-status g-sr-only" role="status"></p>
  <div class="g-wrap">
  <section class="g-home-trip" id="home-trip" aria-labelledby="home-trip-heading"><div><p class="g-label">Your time on the coast</p><h2 id="home-trip-heading">Make yourself<br><em>at home.</em></h2></div>{% set tripFormId = 'home-trip' %}{% include "partials/guest-trip-form.njk" %}</section>
  <section class="g-collection g-section" aria-labelledby="home-collection-heading"><div class="g-section-heading"><div><p class="g-label">A small collection, with a lot of personality</p><h2 id="home-collection-heading">Our homes.<br><em>Your kind of getaway.</em></h2></div><p>A private dock. A big backyard. A corner of Sarasota. Start with the place you want to spend time together.</p></div>
    <div class="g-postcards">{% for home in properties %}<article class="g-postcard"><a href="{{ home.pageUrl }}" data-trip-link><div class="g-postcard-photo"><img data-property-photo="{{ home.slug }}" src="{{ home.photography.photos[0].src }}" srcset="{{ home.photography.photos[0].src | replace('.webp', '-800.webp') }} 800w, {{ home.photography.photos[0].src }} 1400w" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 22vw, 76vw" alt="{{ home.photography.photos[0].alt }}" width="1400" height="933" loading="lazy"><span aria-hidden="true">{{ uiIcon('arrow-up-right') }}</span></div><p class="g-label">{{ home.city }} · Up to {{ home.guests }} guests</p><h3>{{ home.name }}</h3></a><p>{{ home.guestFacts.tagline }}</p></article>{% endfor %}</div>
    <div class="g-collection-end"><p>Every home has a private pool.<br>Which one feels like your vacation?</p><a class="g-button btn-brand" href="/properties/" data-trip-link>Compare our homes <span aria-hidden="true">{{ uiIcon('arrow-up-right') }}</span></a></div>
  </section>
  <section class="g-organizer g-section" aria-labelledby="organizer-heading"><div><p class="g-label">For the person planning it all</p><h2 id="organizer-heading">Less back-and-forth.<br>More “this is the one.”</h2><p>Choose a few homes, compare the rooms and details, then send one link to your group. Your dates and guest count stay with you as you explore.</p><a class="g-button btn-brand" href="/properties/" data-trip-link>Build your shortlist</a></div><ol><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Start with your people</h3><p>Group size comes first. Then narrow by location or a private dock.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>Check the details that matter</h3><p>Who sleeps where. Whether the dog can come. Steps, parking and pool heat.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>Share a choice, then check dates</h3><p>Compare up to three homes. See the current availability and complete total on the booking page.</p></div></li></ol></section>
  <section class="g-local g-section" aria-labelledby="local-heading"><div><p class="g-label">The coast, with a local connection</p><h2 id="local-heading">A little help<br>goes a long way.</h2><p>Seascape is owner-operated. Before you book, ask us about the details that could make or break your stay. We know our homes. <a href="/about-us/">About Seascape</a>.</p><a class="g-inline-link" href="tel:9417048545">Call (941) 704-8545 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="g-guide-list"><a href="/guides/bradenton-vs-sarasota/">Bradenton or Sarasota? <span>Compare the two areas →</span></a><a href="/guides/anna-maria-island-area-guide/">Beach days on Anna Maria Island <span>Plan from a mainland home →</span></a><a href="/guides/anna-maria-island-vs-siesta-key/">Anna Maria Island or Siesta Key? <span>Choose your beach day →</span></a><a class="g-inline-link" href="/guides/">Explore all local guides →</a></div></section>
  <section class="g-home-reviews g-section" aria-labelledby="home-reviews-heading">
    <div class="g-section-heading"><div><p class="g-label">From guests who stayed</p><h2 id="home-reviews-heading">Time well spent.</h2></div><p>Real reviews from the booking listings, in the guests' own words.</p></div>
    <div class="g-review-grid">{% for home in properties %}{% if home.guestFacts.reviews | length %}{% set shortest = home.guestFacts.reviews | sort(false, false, "text.length") | first %}<figure><blockquote><p>“{{ shortest.text }}”</p></blockquote><figcaption>{{ shortest.author }} · {{ shortest.date | monthYear }} · {{ shortest.rating }}/5 · <a href="{{ home.pageUrl }}#reviews" data-trip-link>{{ home.name }}</a></figcaption></figure>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
  </section>
  <section class="g-home-signup g-section" id="email-signup" aria-labelledby="home-signup-heading" data-email-capture-root>
    <div><p class="g-label">A little more coast in your inbox</p><h2 id="home-signup-heading">Your next stay.<br><em>A $50 head start.</em></h2><p>Join our email list for Seascape offers, local tips, and your $50 code for a first direct booking of three nights or more.</p></div>
    <div class="g-home-signup-body">
      <div data-email-capture-content>
        <form class="g-home-signup-form" method="post" action="/.netlify/functions/guest-email-capture" data-guest-email-form hidden data-inline-email-capture="true" data-track-form="email_capture" data-form-submit-event="email_capture_submit" data-page-slug="home" data-form-placement="home_inline" data-utility-moment="homepage_direct_booking_help" data-utility-source-label="homepage_signup" data-requested-value="save50_and_local_stay_ideas" data-guest-intent="planning_gulf_coast_stay" data-delivery-channel="email" data-consent-basis="guest_requested_email_followup">
          <div><label for="home-signup-name">First name</label><input id="home-signup-name" name="name" autocomplete="given-name" required></div>
          <div><label for="home-signup-email">Email address</label><input id="home-signup-email" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required></div>
          <button class="g-button btn-brand" type="submit">Get my $50 code</button>
        </form>
        <p class="g-small" data-email-capture-unavailable>Enable JavaScript to join the list. You can still <a href="/properties/" data-trip-link>browse our homes</a>.</p>
        <p class="g-small">By joining, you agree to receive Seascape marketing emails. Unsubscribe anytime. <a href="/privacy/">Privacy policy</a>.</p>
        <p class="g-capture-error" data-email-capture-error role="alert" hidden>We could not finish saving your email. Please try again in a moment.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-email-capture-pending role="status" hidden><h3>Still confirming your signup.</h3><p>Keep browsing, and try again in a few minutes if this stays pending.</p><a class="g-inline-link" href="/properties/" data-trip-link>Explore our homes →</a></div>
      <div data-email-capture-success role="status" hidden><h3>Your SAVE50 code is ready.</h3><p>Enter <strong>SAVE50</strong> on the secure booking page for your first direct booking of three nights or more. Save the code before you browse.</p><a class="g-button btn-brand" href="/properties/?promo=save50" data-trip-link data-email-capture-browse data-email-capture-default-href="/properties/">Find your home →</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="g-home-owners g-section" aria-labelledby="home-owners-heading">
    <div><p class="g-label">For property owners</p><h2 id="home-owners-heading">Is your rental working<br><em>as hard as you are?</em></h2></div>
    <div><p>If the fees, payouts, or owner updates do not add up, send us your listing link or property address and what feels off. Start with a property-specific revenue review.</p><a class="g-button btn-brand" href="/property-management/#owner-cta" data-track-event="owner_primary_cta_click" data-page-slug="home" data-placement="home_owner_section">Request a revenue review →</a><a class="g-inline-link" href="/property-management/">Explore property management →</a></div>
  </section>
  <section class="g-return g-section"><p class="g-label">Been here before?</p><h2>Your next stay can start with the home you already know.</h2><p>Find it in our collection, choose your dates, and book direct. Have a question from your last visit? Our local team can help.</p><a class="g-inline-link" href="/properties/" data-trip-link>Find your home again <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></section>
</div>
</div>

<script type="application/ld+json">
    {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "WebSite",
        "name": "Seascape Vacations",
        "alternateName": "seascape-vacations.com",
        "url": "https://seascape-vacations.com/",
        "potentialAction": {
            "@type": "SearchAction",
            "target": {
                "@type": "EntryPoint",
                "urlTemplate": "https://seascape-vacations.com/properties/?area={search_term_string}"
            },
            "query-input": "required name=search_term_string"
        }
    }
    </script>
<script type="application/ld+json">{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "LocalBusiness",
  "name": "Seascape Vacations",
  "url": "https://seascape-vacations.com",
  "telephone": "+1-941-704-8545",
  "email": "info@seascape-vacations.com",
  "address": {
    "@type": "PostalAddress",
    "addressLocality": "Bradenton",
    "addressRegion": "FL",
    "addressCountry": "US"
  },
  "areaServed": [
    {
      "@type": "City",
      "name": "Bradenton"
    },
    {
      "@type": "City",
      "name": "Sarasota"
    }
  ]
}</script>

<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"ItemList","name":"Seascape homes","itemListElement":[{% for property in properties %}{"@type":"ListItem","position":{{ loop.index }},"name":{{ property.name | json | safe }},"url":"{{ site.url }}{{ property.pageUrl }}"}{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}]}</script>
